<section style="padding:72px 24px;background:#EAF5FB;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">What equipment do you work on, and where do you operate?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Steam and gas turbines, industrial and standby generating sets, and the rotating equipment in the same trains, including pumps, gearboxes, fans, blowers and compressors. The core services are <a href="/steam-turbine-overhaul-nigeria/">turbine overhaul</a>, <a href="/generator-maintenance-nigeria/">generator maintenance</a>, <a href="/power-plant-audit-nigeria/">plant audits</a> and <a href="/rotating-equipment-services-nigeria/">rotating equipment services</a>. We are based in Lagos and mobilise to plants in Lagos, Rivers, FCT, Kaduna, Delta and Kano States.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">How do you scope work on a machine with no maintenance history?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">We rebuild the history from the machine itself. Nameplate and general arrangement data, operating hour and trip counters, stage pressures and heat rate against design, bearing temperatures, lube oil analysis, alternator insulation testing and a borescope survey give a condition picture without opening the unit. From there the scope is issued in three parts, confirmed work, probable work and contingency, so you can commit a purchase order against the confirmed portion and hold priced cover for the rest.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">What do we receive at handover?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">A close out dossier covering as found and as left clearances, NDT and inspection reports, alignment figures, balance data, protection and overspeed trip test results, spares consumed and a fresh vibration and performance baseline. Photographs are indexed against the component and stage they were taken at, so the record is usable at the next outage rather than decorative. The dossier also carries our recommended inspection interval and the spares to order ahead of it, with indicative budgets set out on our <a href="/generator-turbine-maintenance-cost/">turbine and generator maintenance cost</a> page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
